# RESISTOR_ADAPTER_8: eight 0805 resistors on a small 16-pin DIP adapter board (ProtoAdvantage,
# part number not recorded), 33 ohm (marked 330) on the board. Two are fitted, as the CF data
# series resistors: one for CF D0-D7 (CPU D24-D31), one for CF D8-D15 (CPU D16-D23).
# Pin numbering ASSUMED from a photo of the board, 2026-11-08: resistor k across the board
# between the two pins marked k, which in DIP numbering is pin k to pin 17-k. To be confirmed
# on the board (sparky1 KICAD_MODULES.md, step 5).
#
# pin  name  type
1   R1a passive
2   R2a passive
3   R3a passive
4   R4a passive
5   R5a passive
6   R6a passive
7   R7a passive
8   R8a passive
9   R8b passive
10  R7b passive
11  R6b passive
12  R5b passive
13  R4b passive
14  R3b passive
15  R2b passive
16  R1b passive
